{"3217900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gorilla Showdown", "steam_appid": 3217900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4570500, 4570510], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/dc51f25cd19b6c67e011f2885756f309.avif?t=1778205092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras_big/dc51f25cd19b6c67e011f2885756f309.avif?t=1778205092 width=1560 height=482 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/7f70ec33bde782421707ebd188e3f0c1.avif?t=1778205092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras_big/7f70ec33bde782421707ebd188e3f0c1.webp?t=1778205092 width=1560 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner monkey in a chaotic, rhythm-driven arcade shooter. Boogie, fight and laugh your way through insane parties where <strong>holding the dance pad is the key to victory</strong>. Play with up to 12 players, and even customize the soundtrack with<strong> Steam</strong> <strong>Workshop music packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the beat is your goal. Stand on the pad, match the rhythm, and rack up points - but staying alive is half the battle. <strong>The dance pad has new power-ups every round</strong>, letting you launch missiles, bend time, or laser down rivals in unpredictable musical mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join into a <strong>private lobby</strong> with friends or venture into <strong>public parties</strong> for worldwide fun! <strong>Voice chat </strong>keeps the energy loud and chaotic as you fight, fling bananas, and battle for the beat. <strong>Modes include:</strong> Free-For-All, Teams, Infected, Payload, Banana Grab, Ape Arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across wild, thematic arenas—pirate coves, desert mesas, radiated towns, space stations clubs, and more. <strong>Every stage adds its own surprises, hazards, and unique strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay updated with the latest news and exclusive content by following us on our social medias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don’t want to miss out on this party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/7f70ec33bde782421707ebd188e3f0c1.avif?t=1778205092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras_big/7f70ec33bde782421707ebd188e3f0c1.webp?t=1778205092 width=1560 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner monkey in a chaotic, rhythm-driven arcade shooter. Boogie, fight and laugh your way through insane parties where <strong>holding the dance pad is the key to victory</strong>. Play with up to 12 players, and even customize the soundtrack with<strong> Steam</strong> <strong>Workshop music packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the beat is your goal. Stand on the pad, match the rhythm, and rack up points - but staying alive is half the battle. <strong>The dance pad has new power-ups every round</strong>, letting you launch missiles, bend time, or laser down rivals in unpredictable musical mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.poster.avif?t=1778205092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.webm?t=1778205092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join into a <strong>private lobby</strong> with friends or venture into <strong>public parties</strong> for worldwide fun! <strong>Voice chat </strong>keeps the energy loud and chaotic as you fight, fling bananas, and battle for the beat. <strong>Modes include:</strong> Free-For-All, Teams, Infected, Payload, Banana Grab, Ape Arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn